	'k3345fec6' => 'The meeting matching portal opens on 19 April 2027 for all confirmed buyers and suppliers. Once active, delegates log into the system to view comprehensive profiles of participating organisations, including product specialisations, geographical locations, and procurement specifications. Buyers can submit up to 8 meeting requests, while standard supplier passes permit up to 4 requests. Both parties must mutually confirm meeting invitations. The platform automatically generates a personalised timetable assigning specific 20-minute appointments across the four rounds in Hall B.',
