	'k3681b5c7' => 'The Renkei Forum Association is a non-profit organisation founded in 2019 to bridge the gap between regional manufacturers and institutional procurement teams. Renkei Forum 2027 marks the 6th edition of our annual commercial gathering.',
	'k37279d63' => 'Each supplier exhibition space includes a covered table measuring 180×75 cm, two chairs, and a standard electrical power connection. Suppliers are encouraged to present compact physical goods, material swatches, industrial prototypes, packaging mock-ups, and sample containers or unlabelled jars directly on the tabletop. In order to preserve open sightlines and quiet discussion areas throughout the foyer, freestanding backdrop banners, heavy machinery, and noisy demonstration equipment are strictly prohibited. Setup begins at 08:30 on Thursday 13 May 2027 before delegate registration commences.',
	'k378851ff' => 'The sunlit foyer with rows of linen-covered supplier tables.',
	'k38073e03' => 'To attend Renkei Forum 2027, every prospective delegate must submit a ticket request online before the application deadline on 16 April 2027. Because the forum prioritises focused commercial matching, the Renkei Forum Association conducts an administrative profile review of every submission. We verify your organisation&#039;s procurement remit or manufacturing capabilities to maintain an appropriate ratio between 160 buyers and 220 suppliers. Every application is reviewed and answered within 5 working days with confirmation details and platform access instructions.',
