	'k3fdb78be' => 'Ilse Varga serves as forum director and host of Renkei Forum 2027, having guided the Renkei Forum Association since its foundation in 2019. Her work focuses on connecting municipal and commercial procurement teams with dependable regional manufacturers. At this year&#039;s forum, Ilse opens proceedings in Hall A on Thursday with Sec.01, examining why regional sourcing builds supply resilience. On Friday afternoon, she returns to lead Sec.10, providing actionable guidance on structuring supplier profiles that corporate and institutional buyers read and approve during procurement evaluations.',
	'k402a486b' => 'Chen Wei-Lin',
	'k4079535f' => 'Established in 2019, the Renkei Forum Association is an independent non-profit organisation dedicated to strengthening regional supply chains. We believe that shortening the geographical and commercial distance between buyers and suppliers creates resilient regional economies, reduces logistics overhead, and provides small workshops with stable commercial opportunities. Renkei Forum 2027 represents the 6th edition of our flagship procurement forum. Rather than organising unfocused trade expositions, the association focuses on verified participant profiles, structured 20-minute meeting rounds, and transparent public procurement frameworks that allow local enterprises to compete fairly.',
