	'k607c7ca6' => 'Several neutral hotels are situated within comfortable walking distance of Calder Hall for delegates requiring overnight accommodation in Northport. The Northport Wharf Hotel is located along Wharf Road just five minutes from the venue entrance, offering quiet rooms suitable for business travellers. The Calder Quay Hotel overlooks the waterfront basin two blocks north, providing meeting lounges and straightforward access to Calder Hall. In addition, the Station Walk Inn is positioned adjacent to Northport Central railway station, allowing delegates arriving by train an easy commute to and from the venue.',
