	'k8f76f4c9' => 'Requests close on 16 April 2027 and every request is answered within 5 working days. Places: 160 buyers and 220 suppliers.',
	'k8f7f4c1c' => 'About',
	'k8ff8f8d4' => 'To ensure high commercial value for all participants, complimentary two-day buyer passes (€0) are reserved for professionals with direct purchasing authority. Qualified delegates include category managers, commercial buyers, municipal procurement officers, and institutional sourcing directors. Once you submit a ticket request, the association evaluates your organisation&#039;s purchasing scope and responds within 5 working days. Approved buyers receive full two-day access to Hall A presentations, catering and lunch, and scheduled access to meeting tables across Hall B alongside 160 fellow purchasing delegates.',
	'k9186bf01' => 'Kofi Mensah',
	'k91df932a' => 'criteria for the',
	'k91f76cc5' => 'Amara Nwosu &amp; Rafael Duarte',
	'k92074f57' => 'accommodation',
	'k9223a10c' => 'Forum director',
	'k923b2566' => 'code of conduct',
	'k9276f0c5' => 'Renkei Forum 2027 offers six distinct registration options in EUR. Buyer delegates attend both days free of charge (€0) after profile review, receiving full access to Hall A talks, Hall B meeting rounds, and lunch on both days. A two-day supplier pass costs €290 and includes talks, lunch both days, and up to 4 meeting requests. A one-day supplier pass costs €180 for selected day talks, meetings, and lunch. The two-day supplier table package costs €1,450, providing a 180×75 cm foyer display table with power and 2 supplier passes. Suppliers can purchase a meeting package add-on for €240, granting 6 pre-booked 20-minute meetings. An observer pass is available for €60 over two days for public-sector staff and students for talks only.',
	'k93062657' => 'How a city office turned one large tender into lots that small suppliers can bid for, and what it changed.',
	'k93f33996' => 'While a standard supplier pass permits up to 4 meeting requests, exhibitors and delegates can secure the optional meeting package add-on for €240, which includes 6 pre-booked 20-minute meetings. Once meeting matching opens on 19 April 2027, registered suppliers gain access to verified profiles of 160 commercial and municipal buyers. Review published procurement needs, submit targeted meeting invitations, and confirm appointments prior to arriving at Calder Hall. During the four scheduled matching rounds across 13 and 14 May, you will meet buyers at numbered tables in Hall B.',
	'k94e6e31e' => 'These terms cover tickets, tables and attendance at Renkei Forum 2027 on 13–14 May 2027 at Calder Hall, 12 Wharf Road, Northport.',
	'k955355a8' => 'What are the cancellation and refund terms for paid passes?',
	'k9560f74c' => 'passes',
	'k9662385e' => 'CALDER',
	'k98c613b6' => '13–14 May 2027',
	'k991967c9' => 'What are the dimensions and setup rules for supplier tables?',
	'k99375d55' => 'and foyer',
	'k993b1c32' => 'Every request is answered within 5 working days. Ticket requests close on 16 April 2027 and meeting matching opens on 19 April 2027.',
	'k9a2c0d7f' => 'Talks · 420 seats',
	'k9ab2ec7e' => 'tables',
	'k9af33e81' => 'Supplier tables in the Calder Hall foyer measure 180×75 cm and come complete with clean white linen, two chairs, and an electrical power connection. Suppliers may display material swatches, manufactured components, packaging prototypes, and sample jars directly on the tabletop. Freestanding pull-up banners, floor displays, and noisy electronic machinery are prohibited to maintain clean sightlines and quiet networking. Setup takes place between 08:30 and 09:00 on Thursday 13 May before morning sessions commence.',
	'k9d03a652' => 'Supplier Development Lead, Northport City Procurement Office',
	'k9d89651e' => 'Attendance follows a structured four-step procedure. Step 01 is submitting your ticket request online before requests close on 16 April 2027. In Step 02, the Renkei Forum Association conducts a profile review, answering every application within 5 working days to confirm procurement or manufacturing relevance. In Step 03, our meeting matching platform opens on 19 April 2027, allowing confirmed delegates to review participant profiles and request 20-minute meetings. Finally, Step 04 takes place at Calder Hall during the forum days on Thursday 13 and Friday 14 May 2027, where pre-scheduled tables and plenary sessions occur.',
	'k9df3b01c' => 'access',
	'k9e167afe' => 'sourcing',
	'k9eca4061' => 'Purchasing managers, category leads and public procurement officers receive a buyer delegate pass at €0 once their profile has been reviewed.',
	'k9ed308a9' => 'Place a request, get matched, sit down with the people who buy what you make.',
	'k9f5fc149' => 'A contract textiles workshop and a hospital laundry agreed a 2-year trial of one uniform range.',
	'k9faf970c' => 'Regional manufacturers can participate through individual attendance passes or dedicated exhibition tables. A two-day supplier pass costs €290 and includes access to all 12 sessions in Hall A, lunch both days, and up to 4 meeting requests. A one-day supplier pass is available for €180. For companies wishing to display physical goods, the supplier table package costs €1,450 for both days and includes 2 supplier passes. This option places your enterprise directly in the Calder Hall foyer alongside 40 participating suppliers, ensuring high visibility during morning arrivals, coffee intervals, and the evening reception.',
	'k9fd07cec' => 'Talks, up to 4 meeting requests, lunch both days',
	'k9ffdb952' => 'How it works',
	'ka09658a9' => 'To maximise meeting efficiency, we encourage buyers to upload concise sourcing briefs when completing profile registration. Outline specific material requirements, target annual purchasing volumes, quality standards, and delivery lead times. Sharing clear parameters in advance allows suppliers to review your requirements prior to meeting round selections starting 19 April 2027. Arriving at Calder Hall with defined lot specifications ensures that every 20-minute conversation focuses immediately on technical feasibility, pricing thresholds, and contract capability.',
	'ka153ebcf' => '60 meeting tables',
	'ka273f1bc' => 'What happens next',
	'ka367ebd2' => 'matching flow',
	'ka3bdafb3' => 'Hands fasten a blank fabric badge onto a lanyard at a linen registration desk.',
	'ka442a935' => 'Meeting rounds are distributed evenly across the two-day schedule to balance conference presentations and one-to-one negotiations. On Thursday 13 May, Round 1 runs from 11:15 to 12:45, and Round 2 takes place from 15:30 to 17:00. On Friday 14 May, Round 3 runs from 11:15 to 12:45, followed by Round 4 from 15:15 to 16:15. Each meeting table in Hall B is clearly numbered, and meetings are strictly timed to 20 minutes to maintain punctual rotations.',
	'ka56cacc1' => 'Regional Procurement Forum, organised by the Renkei Forum Association, a non-profit that matches regional buyers with regional suppliers since 2019.',
	'ka5928cab' => 'Blank lanyards, a notebook, a pen and a coffee cup laid flat on linen.',
	'ka59300f7' => 'We use your details to review your profile, answer your request within 5 working days, book meeting tables after matching opens on 19 April 2027 and send the bulletins you asked for. We do not sell your details and we do not send third-party advertising.',
	'ka66ecd43' => 'Transit links and',
	'ka748dc7b' => 'Doors 08:30 · close 16:30',
	'ka7986a83' => 'Meeting packages',
	'ka80cff39' => 'Floor plan',
	'ka858a7b7' => 'Eight procurement leaders, workshop founders, and commercial specialists will share operational insights at Renkei Forum 2027. Each speaker brings direct experience in establishing transparent supply chains across regional markets.',
	'ka866520c' => 'hello@renkeiforum.example',
	'ka8f0be59' => 'Renkei Forum gathers both sides in one hall for two focused days. Instead of walking cavernous exhibition aisles or handing out generic brochures, participants follow a matching schedule built around confirmed procurement needs in packaging, textiles, food and drink, components, logistics and facilities.',
	'kab26cf67' => 'Sec.01',
	'kabfc512c' => 'Meetings &amp;',
	'kac9d9632' => 'Paid tickets are refunded in full until 16 April 2027. After that date a ticket can be transferred to a colleague by writing to the office.',
	'kad967d16' => 'Cash-flow basics for both sides: invoicing cycles, deposits and workable terms.',
	'kade62519' => 'Tickets &amp;',
	'kadfe5979' => 'Supplier table, two days',
	'kb03ad34f' => 'Profile review',
	'kb11088f4' => 'Renkei Forum Association',
	'kb1338793' => 'Eligibility',
	'kb1525c7b' => 'answered.',
	'kb16dfbe1' => 'How does the ticket request and review process work?',
	'kb1b53fe0' => 'A food-safety auditor walks through the checks small producers most often miss and how to prepare.',
	'kb2ecc1ba' => 'What do you buy or make?',
	'kb2f307f6' => 'Thu 13 May',
	'kb35cf798' => 'and targeted rounds',
	'kb3733659' => 'Includes',
	'kb3a5b761' => 'Calder Hall is located 8 minutes on foot from Northport Central railway station, connecting delegates directly to regional rail lines and cross-city trains. Local bus routes stop immediately outside Wharf Road, with frequent service operating throughout both event days. Sheltered bicycle parking racks are situated adjacent to the primary entrance. The entire venue is fully accessible, offering step-free ground-level access, automated exterior doors, wide aisles throughout Hall A, Hall B, and the foyer, as well as accessible facilities designed to accommodate delegates with mobility requirements.',
	'kb3db4593' => 'Join the 2028 waitlist →',
	'kb460c76c' => 'Questions from the floor to the day’s speakers. Reception 17:30–18:30 in the foyer.',
	'kb4a0755f' => 'Your table could be next year’s story.',
	'kb52a6f59' => 'PLANNERS ·',
	'kb6154120' => 'Menu',
	'kb725b811' => 'BUYERS MEET MAKERS ·',
	'kb77548af' => 'Forum days',
	'kb779b3e2' => 'How do I reach Calder Hall using public transit?',
	'kb7f41fc1' => 'Round',
	'kb8498d62' => 'of last year',
	'kb86e6330' => 'Our communications follow a structured timeline leading up to the forum at Calder Hall. Key dates to note include 16 April 2027, when ticket requests close, and 19 April 2027, when one-to-one meeting matching opens for verified participants. Forum proceedings take place across Thursday 13 and Friday 14 May 2027. We do not distribute advertising or third-party solicitations. Every bulletin delivers concise logistical updates, schedule notices, and case summaries prepared directly by our Northport office. You can contact the secretariat at hello@renkeiforum.example.',
	'kb91cfe04' => 'Online, before 16 April 2027.',
	'kb966e5c5' => 'Doors open at 08:30 on both days.',
	'kb9b57aae' => 'Pass',
	'kba1d34fc' => 'The meeting package is an optional add-on available to registered suppliers for €240. This package provides 6 pre-booked, one-to-one 20-minute meetings with verified buyers in Hall B. Our matching team actively reviews your manufacturing capabilities against buyer sourcing briefs, facilitating introductions and reserving designated tables. This service assists suppliers seeking structured commercial dialogues without having to rely solely on unassisted matching requests during the scheduling period.',
	'kba2d257d' => 'Meeting round 1',
	'kba817467' => 'Sec.02',
	'kbaaba7e2' => 'Northport',
	'kbb466d31' => 'Supplier pass, one day',
	'kbb872b0f' => 'Request a ticket',
	'kbbf7fe74' => 'You can ask the office to correct or delete your details, or leave the waitlist, at any time. Write to hello@renkeiforum.example. We keep request data until three months after the forum days, then delete it.',
	'kbdf82e9f' => 'COMPONENTS ·',
	'kbe6fed6d' => 'Table specifications',
	'kbe993d10' => 'Venue',
	'kbee2d356' => 'Cooks unload crates of fresh vegetables in a large public kitchen.',
	'kbf48d1eb' => 'Can I get a refund?',
	'kc0622954' => 'Meeting round 4',
	'kc07c3571' => 'Bakery',
	'kc112bb35' => 'Changes',
	'kc1542657' => 'A grocery cooperative&#039;s move to regional packaging makers: specifications and lead times.',
	'kc1c694bd' => 'Tickets',
	'kc1ca688e' => 'Eight people who buy,',
	'kc22e22c5' => 'Office hours and',
	'kc2cc000d' => 'MAKERS ·',
	'kc2e6af9c' => 'Supplier pass, two days',
	'kc32b01f2' => 'PACKAGING ·',
	'kc3f8247b' => 'Calder Hall at 12 Wharf Road in Northport provides three primary spaces tailored for the forum. Hall A hosts all 12 speaker presentations, accommodating 420 seated delegates facing a low central stage. Hall B contains 60 numbered meeting tables arranged specifically for the four scheduled 20-minute buyer and supplier matching rounds. The bright ground-floor foyer accommodates 40 linen-covered supplier exhibition tables. On Thursday 13 May 2027, doors open at 08:30 and close at 18:30, following an evening supplier reception held in the foyer between 17:30 and 18:30. On Friday 14 May 2027, doors open at 08:30 and the venue closes at 16:30.',
	'kc40643e4' => 'What buyers look for in the first minute, and how to put it on one page.',
	'kc4f3263a' => 'Fewer cold emails.',
	'kc5bdd07d' => '12 sessions · 8 speakers · 4 meeting rounds',
	'kc5f29bb3' => 'Privacy',
	'kc6292e5a' => 'Case 03',
	'kc7494b59' => 'Hall B, 20-minute tables. Last chance to book a follow-up.',
	'kc7c7146c' => 'Send request',
	'kc8972503' => 'The association is directed by Ilse Varga, who serves as forum host and leads our operations team in Northport. Ilse works closely with regional procurement offices, trade federations, and municipal development bodies to design programs that address real purchasing challenges. Supported by an experienced administrative staff, our leadership oversees profile verification, technical session curation in Hall A, and the matching engine that coordinates 60 meeting tables in Hall B. We measure success by the durability of the commercial contracts established between our 160 buyers and 220 suppliers.',
	'kc8f88984' => 'Request a',
	'kc978a461' => 'I am a',
	'kca0e0b30' => 'During the 2026 edition of Renkei Forum, a regional bakery cooperative met with the management of an independent grain mill situated 60 kilometres away. Prior to the forum, the bakery group had sourced flour through a national wholesale distributor, incurring long transit intervals and erratic delivery scheduling. The structured 20-minute meeting in Hall B allowed both parties to review grain specifications, monthly baking volumes, and pallet configurations. By eliminating intermediate logistics steps, the mill established a direct supply agreement featuring regular monthly deliveries directly to the cooperative&#039;s central production facility. For the bakery cooperative, the contract secured reliable delivery dates, fresher flour batches, and direct contact with the miller. For the regional mill, the partnership provided predictable monthly milling volume and a stable, multi-month purchasing relationship with a reliable commercial partner.',
	'kca1b12f7' => 'Matching',
	'kca1e69ca' => 'Supplier development lead, Northport city procurement office',
	'kca94f20c' => 'Head and shoulders portrait of a woman in her fifties against a plain light grey wall.',
	'kcb6249f4' => 'Speaker 06',
	'kcbb37401' => 'Stories',
	'kcbf3867a' => 'If you do not hear from us within 5 working days, write to hello@renkeiforum.example and mention the name on your request.',
	'kcc1ca842' => 'Join us at Calder Hall on 13–14 May 2027 for talks, supplier tables and pre-booked meetings.',
	'kcc7a870a' => 'of buyers.',
	'kcd494d76' => 'Contracts',
	'kcd5ee3a8' => 'Sec.05',
	'kcdfee2bc' => 'ticket',
	'kce8ae9da' => 'Email',
	'kcec8de98' => 'Sec.11',
	'kced9db8e' => 'A bakery cooperative found a flour mill 60 km from its ovens at the 2026 forum and moved from ad-hoc orders to monthly deliveries.',
	'kcfe99128' => 'The Renkei Forum Association secretariat operates Monday through Friday from 09:00 to 17:00, reachable by email at hello@renkeiforum.example. All participants at Renkei Forum 2027 agree to adhere to our professional code of conduct. We require respectful commercial dialogue, punctual attendance at scheduled 20-minute meeting tables, transparent disclosure of procurement specifications, and absolute restraint from aggressive, unsolicited sales tactics. Our objective is to maintain an equitable, productive business environment where suppliers and buyers can negotiate open, sustainable commercial agreements.',
	'kd03cf289' => 'Portrait of Tomás Ferreira.',
	'kd0593c93' => 'Small-Business Finance Adviser',
	'kd06b54fc' => 'Contract textiles workshop',
	'kd0ebfdea' => 'Head and shoulders portrait of a woman in a blazer against a plain grey wall.',
	'kd0fbda98' => 'Page not found',
	'kd35996f5' => 'the right people.',
	'kd3dd1f12' => 'Most regional trade falters on the difficulty of making first contact. Suppliers spend months emailing procurement departments without knowing who handles their category, while purchasing teams search directories and trade registers unable to tell which regional workshops have real capacity.',
	'kd4e176bf' => 'While formal one-to-one meetings are conducted at the 60 numbered tables in Hall B during the four official rounds, attendees have multiple opportunities for informal discussions throughout the forum. The ground-floor foyer, morning registration intervals, scheduled lunch breaks, and the evening supplier reception on Thursday from 17:30 to 18:30 provide comfortable spaces to continue conversations. However, formal buyer meeting tables in Hall B are accessible only during scheduled matching rounds.',
	'kd5ea785d' => 'Who can attend using an observer pass?',
	'kd67b6430' => 'A visitor picks up packaging, fabric swatches and glass jars from a supplier table.',
	'kd6ba8768' => 'Calder Hall',
	'kd6fbd40c' => 'What is included with the €240 meeting package add-on?',
	'kd7a2ce1e' => 'Conduct',
	'kd8353ad0' => 'Kofi Mensah is a financial adviser specialising in working capital management and cash flow structures for growing manufacturing businesses. He works with regional suppliers to establish balanced commercial agreements that prevent operational insolvency during contract fulfilment. On Friday morning, Kofi delivers Sec.09, titled Payment terms that keep suppliers alive. His session addresses milestone billing, staged deposits, invoice payment terms, and working capital safeguards that procurement teams and suppliers should agree upon to maintain financial stability throughout long-term delivery contracts.',
